CREATED:20261011T195303Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261011T195303Z
UID:10691-1792315800-1792324800@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:Loving Me: Breathwork & Sound Healing with Heal Your Love
DESCRIPTION:Loving Me: Breathwork & Sound Healing with Darren and Gloria of Heal Your Love\nSunday morning\, October 18\, 9:30 – 12 noon\, $55 \nRegister for your spot here! \nJoin us every third Sunday of the month for a deeply restorative sound healing with Darren and Gloria of Heal Your Love. We are dedicated to creating a safe and nurturing space for those seeking holistic wellness in a communal setting. \nThrough breath-work and sound healing\, we facilitate a deeply restorative experience that helps release anxiety\, stress\, and trauma from the body while fostering gratitude\, peace\, and self-love. Our gathering is rooted in the safety of community\, with facilitators trained in spiritual care and well-being. \nThis Self-Love Healing Circle is a unique opportunity to connect with others on their journey\, share experiences\, and nurture your well-being in a supportive space. \n✨ Don’t miss this transformative and deeply nourishing experience! ✨ \nRegister for your spot here! \n  \nWear comfortable clothing. \nWe encourage you to bring yoga mats and blankets\, although some are available here to use. \n \nDarren and Gloria Hagood are the founders of Heal Your Love. They are deeply attuned practitioners who approach their work with open hearts\, and are committed to healing through love.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/loving-me-breathwork-sound-healing-with-heal-your-love/
LOCATION:the Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042
CATEGORIES:Meditation,Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/♡-e1762395661903.jpeg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
