SUMMARY:Knitting 101
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nDo you want to learn to knit? Did you learn years ago and have 
 forgotten the basics?\n\nThis is the class for you! You will learn the very 
 basics of knitting: casting on\, binding off\, the knit stitch\, and the 
 purl stitch. By the end of the class you will have completed a warm cowl or 
 scarf and will have an adaptable pattern to take home with you.\n\nStudents 
 will bring their own materials.\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Arts & Crafts
