SUMMARY:Indoor Rock Climbing
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nInterested in picking up a new athletic hobby? Indoor 
 Bouldering is considered the ultimate full body workout that combines 
 physical challenges and problem solving\, all within a welcoming community 
 open to all ability levels. Our experienced instructors will lead a class 
 every week for 4 consecutive weeks. These classes provide an environment 
 where students will learn climbing techniques\, build strength\, confidence 
 and of course\, have fun while doing it! No prior experience necessary and 
 all required equipment is included.
LOCATION:Montclair - The Gravity Vault Montclair\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
