SUMMARY:Introduction to Drawing with Colored Pencils
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class.\n\nPerfect for both 
 beginners and experienced artists\, this adult drawing class will explore 
 the unique blend of traditional colored pencils with watercolor pencils. 
 Learn how to create vibrant\, layered artwork with depth and color. \n\nArt 
 supplies are not included and must be purchased prior to the start of 
 class. Go here for art supply information.\n
LOCATION:Montclair - Cornerstone Montclair\, Montclair Public Library
