 You can bring your own book from home or borrow one from the library! 
 \n\nRegistration is required. Please only register for one seat per family. 
 This program is for children ages 6 and up to help them build their 
 independent reading skills. Children must attend with an adult. \n\nTherapy 
 dogs are certified volunteers from Bright & Beautiful Therapy Dogs. \n\nDue 
