SUMMARY:October Book Club: Is This a Cry for Help?
DESCRIPTION:A book club for adults who want to read in community. We meet 
 one Friday morning a month to chat about a title we read in 
 common.\n\n--\n\nIS THIS A CRY FOR HELP?\nby Emily Austin (2026)\n\nA 
 librarian recovering from a mental health crisis triggered by grief and 
 loss returns to work...only to be met by a community in crisis over 
 book-banning. Austin brings her trademark heart and humor to this 
 empowering story of love\, new adulthood\, queer identity\, and the fight 
 for intellectual freedom.
LOCATION:Literacy Room\, West Orange Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Book Club
UID:LibCal-10341-17302613
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17302613
END:VEVENT
