DESCRIPTION:**Unpacking the Israeli Elections**  \nWe are thrilled to welc
 ome back MetroWest Shlicha (emissary) Daniella Gefen for an insightful dis
 cussion on the upcoming Israeli elections. Daniella will break down the co
 ntentious issues driving Israelis to the polls and clarify the complex pro
 cess of forming a coalition government.  \n  \nDrawing from her background
  as an educator\, community activist\, and clinical social worker\, Daniel
 la will deliver an engaging and accessible presentation you won't want to 
 miss.  \n  \nSponsored by the Shomrei Israel Committee and Jewish Federati
 on of Greater Metrowest  \n  \n**------------------------------**  \n  \n*
 *Cost:** Free or Suggested Donation of $18 per person (to help cover event
  costs).  \n  \n**Open to:** Shomrei Community and their Invited Friends  
 \n  \n**RSVP:** Registration is required and will close at 4:00 pm on Octo
 ber 22.  \nhttps://shomrei.easyshul.com/events/6aac0baee0deac002612f8d2  \
 n  \n**Questions?** Contact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(9
 73) 746-5031 ext. 0\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261009T232503Z
LOCATION:Social Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
