SUMMARY:The Corner Book Club meeting
DESCRIPTION:Read and come prepared to discuss a NY Times bestselling 
 novel\, "The Art Forger" by B. A. Shapiro. Narrated by its protagonist\, 
 Claire Roth\, this novel delves into famous paintings by Degas and how 
 often there are copies made of these works.  How does Claire continue to 
 paint?  Will she be involved in forging a famous Degas painting? 
 \n\nRegistration is required.
LOCATION:Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Bellevue Avenue Branch":MAILTO:branch-events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Bellevue Avenue Branch, Book Discussion
UID:LibCal-10306-17606544
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17606544
END:VEVENT
