SUMMARY:Beginner Irish - In Person
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to register. 
 \n\nJoin us for a beginner's introduction to the Irish language! This class 
 will cover spelling\, pronunciation\, common phrases and vocabulary. Along 
 the way\, you will learn Irish first and last names and the original\, 
 meaningful place names (Logainmneacha) of Ireland.\n
