SUMMARY:Halloween HullaBOO!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a full day of Halloween fun at the 
 library!\n\n\n	10:30AM - Make & Take Crafts - Stop by and create a 
 Halloween themed craft! Available while supplies last.\n	10:30AM - 2:00PM - 
 Dark\, Dark Room - Step into our decorated story time room for a spooky 
 storytelling experience! Stories begin every 30 minutes.\n	12:00PM - 1:00PM 
 - STEM Saturday - Join us for a Halloween-themed STEM activity!\n	2:30PM - 
 Spooky Storytime - Gather around for Halloween stories and fun.\n	This is 
 the last day to complete our Halloween scavenger hunt. Have you found them 
 all?\n	Don't forget to visit our candy station for a sweet Halloween 
 treat!\n\n\nCome for one activity or stay all day - the Children's Room 
 will be filled with Halloween fun. Costumes are encouraged!
