SUMMARY:Puzzle Challenge Night - Register a team!
DESCRIPTION:Form a team of 2-5 students and adults. Register your team 
 once.\n\nPuzzle Night invites teams to compete to see who can complete the 
 same 500 piece jigsaw puzzle the fastest. At the start of the tournament\, 
 each team will receive an identical puzzle. Once the clock begins\, teams 
 will have 60 minutes to assemble their puzzle and race to the 
 finish.\n\nThe program is open to all ages. Children under 8 years must be 
 accompanied by an adult at all times. Glen Ridge residents only. If you 
 need to cancel your registration\, please let us know.\n\nChallenge your 
 cognitive skills in this friendly competition. Winners will be awarded!
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Children's Area\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:STEAM/STEM
