SUMMARY:Slow Yoga & Meditation
DESCRIPTION:with Lea Peace & fellow members of Empty Cloud 
 monastery\n\nTake a moment to re-center with instructors from the Empty 
 Cloud monastery in this peaceful\, contemplative yoga and meditation 
 practice. While seated in chairs\, participants will engage in breathing 
 control and concentration\, explore the range of motion in their joints\, 
 and strengthen their core muscles\, then stand up and balance for a brief 
 period.\n\nAbout the presenter\n\nLea Peace has been practicing yoga for 
 years and is certified for yoga instruction by the Kripalu Center for Yoga 
 and Health in Massachusetts. She will be joined by fellow members of Empty 
 Cloud\, a gender-inclusive international Buddhist monastery based in West 
 Orange. \n\n
LOCATION:West Orange - Community Room 1
ORGANIZER;CN="West Orange Library":MAILTO:events@westorange.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Health & Wellness
