X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ics Kstx8Swyw669Kakgqa 6478083 Ics": "https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2144131246"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ics_kstx8swyw669kakgqa_6478083_ics
SUMMARY:Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives\, Pa
 rt II
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T180000
DTSTAMP:20261017T000314Z
UID:TU2144131246
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261115T160000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260804T175205Z
DESCRIPTION:**Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narrative
 s\, Part II**  \nA Learning Series led by Rabbi Justus Baird   \n  \nA thr
 ee-part series exploring dual narratives of events in Israel/Palestine\, s
 pecifically from Israeli Jewish and Palestinian points of view. The goal o
 f the series is not to debate those narratives nor change our own\, but si
 mply to hear and engage with them.  \n  \nIn this session\, we will focus 
 on narratives of the early Zionist movement and Jewish immigration\, up to
  and including the Balfour Declaration and its impact (1880s - 1920).   \n
   \nAdvance reading\, approximately two book chapters\, is required. Pleas
 e register so that Rabbi Justus can share pre-reading materials with you b
 efore the class.   \n  \n**Registration**: https://shomrei.easyshul.com/ev
 ents/6ac90befe0b01c00261147e5  \n  \nParticipants should expect the learni
 ng to be challenging and difficult\, emotionally and psychologically.  \n 
  \nThis session is open to all\, whether you attended Part I of the series
  or not.   \n  \nThe first session\, on May 17\, covered the establishment
  of the State of Israel\, what Palestinians call the Naqba. The third and 
 final session\, scheduled for January 10\, will explore the First Intifada
 .  \n  \nPlease remember to bring your fob to access the building.  \n  \n
 **Questions?**  \nContact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973
 ) 746-5031\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261009T232500Z
LOCATION:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07042\,
  USA\, Social Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2144131246
X-SOURCE:Congregation Shomrei Emunah
X-TEAMUP-ROOM:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07
 042\, USA\, Social Hall
END:VEVENT
