SUMMARY:Romance Book Club: Tropesick
DESCRIPTION:Tropesick\nby Lauren Oakie (2026)\n\nTwo childhood neighbors\, 
 connected by a shared tragedy\, reunite to ghostwrite a love story for a 
 reclusive author and discover that dozens of classic romance tropes\, 
 including the ones they’re crafting on page\, are mysteriously playing 
 out in real life.\n\n
