DESCRIPTION:<span>The clergy leaders of five of Verona&#39\;s houses of wo
 rship and one in West Orange will host an Interfaith Thanksgiving Service.
  The service will include scripture readings from Jewish\, Islamic &amp\; 
 Christian traditions\, as well as music related to Thanksgiving with a joi
 nt choir from a few of the congregations. A light reception will follow.</
 span><p></p><p><i><span>Questions?</span></i><span> <span> </span>Contact
  any of the clergy leaders at the participating houses of worship: the <b>
 First Congregational Church of Verona\, </b>the <b>First Presbyterian Chur
 ch of Verona</b>\, <b>Our Lady of the Lake Roman Catholic Church</b>\, the
 <b> Islamic Center of Verona</b><span>\,</span><b> </b>the<b> Episcopal Ch
 urch of the Holy Spirit</b><span> and </span><b>B’nai Shalom West Orange
 </b><span>.</span></span></p>
