DESCRIPTION:Each Sunday\, our 8am service is available<b><b> online via Zo
 om</b></b> OR you<b><b> may attend in-person</b></b> in the Chapel. <p>
 Via computer/smartphone (ideally with a camera and microphone):<b><b> <a 
 href="https://zoom.us/j/2010208686" target="_blank"><b>https://zoom.us/j/2
 010208686</b></a></b></b></p><p>Telephone (for audio only): 1 (646) 876 99
 23 - Meeting ID: 201 020 8686 - Participant ID = # (not applicable).</p>
 <p>Email <b><b><a href="mailto:office@holyspiritverona.org?subject=Worshi
 p%20Password" target="_blank"><b>office@holyspiritverona.org</b></a></b></
 b> for the <b><b>required passcode</b></b>.</p><p>For a copy of our <b>
 <b>Sunday Worship Booklet and Scripture Insert\, <a href="https://www.ho
 lyspiritverona.org/worship-booklet-and-scripture-readings.html" target="_b
 lank"><b>click here</b></a></b></b>.</p><p>A contemplative service in our 
 historic All Saints Chapel. The Worship (about 40 minutes) includes <b><b
 >silence and Taize chants</b></b> as we praise God early on a Sunday morn
 ing.</p><p>"Be still and know that I am God." - Psalm 46:10</p><p> </p><u
 ></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260504T190653Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
END:VEVENT
