 tor:Jennifer Hondru-CelestinJoin our welcoming community for a meditative 
 yoga flow practice in the Van Vleck living room overlooking the charming c
 ourtyard gardens. All levels of yoga experience are welcome in this dynami
 c\, inclusive class. Our teacherJennifer Hondru-Celestin takesinspiration 
 from the natural beauty around us to flow with the seasons\, blending mind
