 Korean food at home doesn't have to be intimidating or complicated—in 
 fact\, it can be as fun and engaging as reading your favorite graphic 
 novel! Join us for a virtual conversation with artist and author Robin Ha 
 as we explore her New York Times bestselling book\, Cook Korean!: A Comic 
