DTSTART:20270109T153000Z
DTEND:20270109T163000Z
DTSTAMP:20270109T000000Z
SUMMARY:Birds in the Neighborhood - Grades K-5
DESCRIPTION:This presentation features twelve birds that are relatively 
 easy to spot in Northern New Jersey.  Participants will learn how to 
 visually identify each bird\, then they will listen to the calls or songs 
 of each bird\, and then we will discuss the birds' favorite foods.  
 \n\nAfter the talk\, participants will visit the "Birdseed Bar" and use a 
 colorful bird feeding chart to create a custom seed mix that will attract 
 their favorite birds.  Glass mason jar mugs (and lids) will be provided so 
 participants can bring their birdseed home in a zero-waste container.
LOCATION:Glen Ridge - Meeting Room\, Glen Ridge Free Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Glen Ridge Library":MAILTO:events@glenridgelibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Special Event
UID:LibCal-10286-17731183
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17731183
END:VEVENT
