SUMMARY:Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narratives\, Pa
 rt III
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270110T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270110T180000
DTSTAMP:20261017T000314Z
UID:TU2144131245
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20270110T160000
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Events
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260804T175205Z
DESCRIPTION:**Side By Side: Delving into Israeli and Palestinian Narrative
 s about the First Intifada**  \nA Conversation led by Rabbi Justus Baird  
 \n  \nIn this three-part learning series\, we will explore multiple narrat
 ives of the last century of events in Israel/Palestine\, specifically from
  Israeli Jewish and Palestinian points of view. The goal will not be to de
 bate those narratives nor change our own\, but simply to hear and engage w
 ith them.  \n  \nThe first session in May focused on the establishment of 
 the State of Israel.   \nThe second session in November focused on the Bal
 four Declaration period.  \nThis third session will focus on the First Int
 ifada.  \n  \nPlease register so that Rabbi Justus can share materials wit
 h you before the class.   \n(link to come)  \n  \nParticipants should expe
 ct the learning to be challenging and difficult\, emotionally and psycholo
 gically.  \n  \nReading in advance of each session will be strongly encour
 aged.  \n  \nJoining both sessions is recommended but not required.  \n  \
 nPlease remember to bring your fob to access the building.  \n  \n**Questi
 ons?**  \nContact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973) 746-50
 31\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008T232327Z
LOCATION:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07042\,
  USA\, Social Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL;VALUE=URI:https://teamup.com/kstx8swyw669kakgqa/events/2144131245
X-SOURCE:Congregation Shomrei Emunah
X-TEAMUP-ROOM:Congregation Shomrei Emunah\, 67 Park St\, Montclair\, NJ 07
 042\, USA\, Social Hall
END:VEVENT
